                            10
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَوْدَعَهُ مَالًا</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He intrusted him with property; intrusted to him property; gave property
to him in trust,</i> or <i>as a deposit.</i> (Msb.) And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَوْدَعَهُ وَدِيعَةً</span>
                        <i>He asked him to keep, preserve,
guard,</i> or <i>take care of, a deposit.</i> (K.)

